  tasks:
  - msg: Hey! Welcome to the Team! Go ahead and setup at desk 5.
    isComplete: 0
    go_taskGrouping: {fileID: 252472420}
    onStartTask:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onCompleteTask:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - msg: Great job! Now, I need you to print me some documents at the printer near
      the elevator and put them on your coworker Jim's desk. He's cubicle 2.
    isComplete: 0
    go_taskGrouping: {fileID: 1563273022}
    onStartTask:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onCompleteTask:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - msg: Great work! Tell Jim to look alive! He's got a report to get to me on those
      documents. Oh, and Clarence is asking me, to ask you to refill his coffee mug.
      He's at his desk. Chop chop Intern.
    isComplete: 0
    go_taskGrouping: {fileID: 387523265}
    onStartTask:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onCompleteTask:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - msg: Thanks for re-filling Clarence's coffee! You've been a real team player!
      Why don't you ask him if he likes it?
